msgid ""
"其余 RunConfig 反射 flag（``--model.*`` / ``--data.*`` / ``--general.*``）与 "
"``train.py`` 相同；``optuna_search.py --help`` 查看完整参考。搜索空间由模型 "
"``ModelConfig`` 字段上的 ``metadata={'optuna': ...}`` 注解派生，无需单独的参数空间文件。"
msgstr ""
"The remaining reflective RunConfig flags (``--model.*`` / ``--data.*`` / "
"``--general.*``) match ``train.py``; run ``optuna_search.py --help`` for the "
"full reference. The search space is derived from the ``metadata={'optuna': "
"...}`` annotations on the model's ``ModelConfig`` fields — no separate "
"parameter-space file is needed."

